cloud and, you know,

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:55.610
kind of help them with the
migration and digital innovation

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.280
as we went through that,

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.770
I spent a few years at Mobify,

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:01.490
a company now acquired by Salesforce,

