00:29:54.050 --> 00:29:56.910
what it does, and what its impact is

00:29:56.910 --> 00:29:58.260
to the overall application.

00:29:59.420 --> 00:30:01.610
So which Svelte app template?

00:30:01.610 --> 00:30:04.430
Let's choose skeleton
project for this question.

00:30:06.710 --> 00:30:09.690
The next question is, do
we want to use TypeScript?

