start to introduce Prisma

00:30:14.080 --> 00:30:17.990
as well as when we work with
the code in our application.

00:30:17.990 --> 00:30:21.750
So let's say yes for the question,
whether to use TypeScript

00:30:23.350 --> 00:30:27.090
and then yes lint for code linting.

00:30:27.090 --> 00:30:30.660
We're going to say no, that's,
