I highly recommend you
do that in your project.

00:30:39.580 --> 00:30:42.140
Once you went through the
course and do more familiar

00:30:42.140 --> 00:30:45.340
with the full stack web
application development,

00:30:45.340 --> 00:30:46.560
in the case here,

00:30:46.560 --> 00:30:50.020
we are not going to configure
this as part of the course.

00:30:50.020 --> 00:30:52.690
So we are going to say, add
Prettier for code formatting.

00:30:52.690 --> 00:30:53.523
No.

