00:35:25.860 --> 00:35:28.620
and that we'll talk about
the branch in just a second

00:35:28.620 --> 00:35:32.630
for now, let's change the title
to something more readable

00:35:34.360 --> 00:35:36.020
I need a description,

00:35:36.020 --> 00:35:39.490
I like to say which issue we are closing.

00:35:39.490 --> 00:35:41.020
In this case, it's number one.

00:35:42.150 --> 00:35:45.400
If you don't remember which
