Before we do any more coding though,

00:40:29.320 --> 00:40:32.390
I want to go through and make
sure you fully understand

00:40:32.390 --> 00:40:36.120
what the different files
and directories are

00:40:36.120 --> 00:40:37.730
within our project.

00:40:37.730 --> 00:40:39.640
If you are already familiar

00:40:39.640 --> 00:40:41.850
with a SvelteKit application,

00:40:41.850 --> 00:40:46.097
then feel free to fast
