to show the correct aria label,

01:41:36.730 --> 01:41:39.700
whether to mark an item
as done or not done.

01:41:39.700 --> 01:41:44.150
For now, we don't know that,
so we'll make it more generic,

01:41:44.150 --> 01:41:47.100
and also that reminds us later
