01:41:49.231 --> 01:41:54.130
Okay, that is the form for this check box.

01:41:54.130 --> 01:41:58.320
Next we need to work on
that text that's shown here.

01:42:00.180 --> 01:42:04.700
That's exactly the same
concept so we can type form.

01:42:06.390 --> 01:42:07.620
We don't know the action yet,

01:42:07.620 --> 01:42:09.420
we don't know the method yet either.

01:42:10.510 --> 01:42:14.880
What we do know is that we want
an input field of type text,

01:42:16.200 --> 01:42:20.110
and we don't know the value at
this point, so just add that.

01:42:20.950 --> 01:42:24.540
And the other thing we want
