01:43:47.270 --> 01:43:52.270
Very good, that gives us the
forms we need for that element.

01:43:54.530 --> 01:43:57.380
Now in the UI, we don't
see any of that yet.

01:43:57.380 --> 01:43:59.500
So what we have to do is

01:44:01.177 --> 01:44:04.340
switch over back to our
source, routes, index.Svelte.

01:44:05.180 --> 01:44:07.650
And we have to import that component,

01:44:07.650 --> 01:44:10.080
that todo-item component we created,

01:44:11.030 --> 01:44:15.920
the way to do that in
Svelte is very interesting

01:44:15.920 --> 01:44:18.160
and also extremely handy.

01:44:18.160 --> 01:44:21.750
So what do you see right now is pure HTML,

01:44:23.268 --> 01:44:27.140
this is no JSX, no, you know,

01:44:27.140 --> 01:44:29.880
library on top of HTML
or anything like that.

01:44:29.880 --> 01:44:34.040
It's just HTML the way to
browse that or understands HTML.

01:44:35.360 --> 01:44:40.360
In order to import a component in Svelte,

01:44:40.360 --> 01:44:45.360
you can add your scripts
that are needed on this route

01:44:45.780 --> 01:44:49.130
or in this component particular
right to the same file.

01:44:49.130 --> 01:44:52.300
So at the top, it doesn't have
to be at the top, by the way,

01:44:52.300 --> 01:44:55.880
it could be below as well,
but I prefer it at the top.

01:44:55.880 --> 01:45:00.880
You can add a script tag, that's
a regular HTML script tag.

01:45:02.620 --> 01:45:07.620
And within that, we can
say import todo-items.

01:45:09.420 --> 01:45:13.030
This is going to be the name
of our todo-item component.

01:45:13.030 --> 01:45:14.930
And where do we want to input it from?

01:45:16.240 --> 01:45:19.100
One directory up, we are in routes,

01:45:20.042 --> 01:45:22.990
so one up and then lib, todo-item.

01:45:24.810 --> 01:45:27.850
That imports the todo-item,
now it's not used,

01:45:27.850 --> 01:45:31.880
so it get a little notification here,

01:45:31.880 --> 01:45:34.000
but we can come down here

01:45:36.310 --> 01:45:40.090
and say todo-item, render one of them.

01:45:40.960 --> 01:45:43.650
We go back, you can now see that

01:45:44.560 --> 01:45:47.510
