files also within the routes

02:49:43.550 --> 02:49:48.100
directory that end in
dot TS for TypeScript

02:49:48.100 --> 02:49:51.110
or dot JS if you use JavaScript.

02:49:52.780 --> 02:49:56.180
Now SvelteKit is then smart enough

02:49:56.180 --> 02:50:01.110
to determine the file ending
and parse the file differently

02:50:01.110 --> 02:50:04.090
and the behavior of that
will be different too,

02:50:04.090 --> 02:50:09.090
but it does use the roots
and the file system here

02:50:09.190 --> 02:50:11.700
to determine the path of our API.

02:50:12.540 --> 02:50:16.070
Now, if you recall, in our issue,

