We can copy that todos.JSON,

02:50:29.500 --> 02:50:33.050
and under routes,

02:50:33.050 --> 02:50:36.080
we want to create a new
directory called todos.

02:50:37.700 --> 02:50:41.500
We could call this API slash todos.

02:50:41.500 --> 02:50:42.830
We could call it whatever we want.

