expects, and all that.

02:54:17.460 --> 02:54:20.980
So we can come here and
this is now TypeScript,

02:54:20.980 --> 02:54:24.580
so if you have a JS file,
then that will not work.

02:54:24.580 --> 02:54:27.450
What we can say that get function.

02:54:30.330 --> 02:54:34.310
I want to annotate it
as a request handler.

02:54:34.310 --> 02:54:38.100
And now if we remove these two items,

