02:55:07.430 --> 02:55:09.680
What else do I have, a body,

02:55:12.140 --> 02:55:13.170
hello from the API.

02:55:15.380 --> 02:55:20.080
So TypeScript really just
gives us some pointers

02:55:20.940 --> 02:55:25.620
and suggestions and helps
