03:01:18.410 --> 03:01:23.410
which is right here, interestingly
enough, we have a form.

03:01:24.110 --> 03:01:29.110
The action attribute here is
the URL that we want to target.

03:01:29.900 --> 03:01:34.260
So in our case, it is todos.JSON.

03:01:35.740 --> 03:01:39.300
As you remember todos.JSON is this file.

03:01:40.490 --> 03:01:43.070
Now we want to target the post endpoint.

03:01:43.070 --> 03:01:44.760
So we can say the method,

03:01:44.760 --> 03:01:48.620
which refers to the HTTP
method that is being used,

03:01:48.620 --> 03:01:51.060
we want this to be post.

03:01:54.760 --> 03:01:57.520
There's a lot going on,
