03:04:15.960 --> 03:04:16.793
Good.

03:04:17.830 --> 03:04:22.450
One thing that I don't
like is the fact that

03:04:23.640 --> 03:04:28.170
we end up on this todos.JSON endpoint URL.

03:04:28.170 --> 03:04:31.110
That's really not user-friendly
because we don't want

03:04:31.110 --> 03:04:33.810
to navigate back to add another todo-item.

03:04:34.710 --> 03:04:37.790
So what we can do is deal with that.

03:04:37.790 --> 03:04:41.320
The reason this happens is because that's

03:04:41.320 --> 03:04:44.800
the default behavior, when
you submit an HTML form,.

03:04:45.920 --> 03:04:48.810
In our case, we can deal
