03:05:09.320 --> 03:05:10.880
we don't have to return a body

03:05:10.880 --> 03:05:14.270
because the browser doesn't
care what was submitted,

03:05:14.270 --> 03:05:19.270
but we can return a headers
object and within that,

03:05:20.230 --> 03:05:25.230
because it's a 300
redirect, response code.

03:05:27.120 --> 03:05:32.120
We can say location, back to our page.

03:05:33.440 --> 03:05:35.940
In this case, we want to
go back to the root page.

03:05:36.900 --> 03:05:39.300
Let's see what that does
