and we call it delete.

04:03:51.130 --> 04:03:53.828
Okay so we are in the request object

04:03:53.828 --> 04:03:56.500
that our API eventually gets.

04:03:56.500 --> 04:03:58.640
There will be a created parameter

04:03:58.640 --> 04:04:01.350
called _method equals delete.

04:04:01.350 --> 04:04:03.868
So that will help us identify

04:04:03.868 --> 04:04:06.270
where do we want to do a delete.

04:04:06.270 --> 04:04:08.440
Even though we are actually
sending a post request

04:04:08.440 --> 04:04:09.650
