04:04:58.179 --> 04:05:01.130
that we can use in SvelteKit.

04:05:01.130 --> 04:05:04.120
Basically when that request is sent

04:05:04.120 --> 04:05:07.090
from the browser to the
SvelteKit application,

04:05:07.980 --> 04:05:12.570
we can intercept the request
before it reaches our API

04:05:13.730 --> 04:05:16.980
and the place to do that is a file

04:05:16.980 --> 04:05:20.920
