One, just like we specify this parameter

04:21:46.150 --> 04:21:48.670
to be optional with the question mark,

04:21:48.670 --> 04:21:53.670
we could go to the global.TS
and make all these optional,

04:21:54.600 --> 04:21:56.180
but then that kind of defeats

04:21:56.180 --> 04:21:59.690
the purpose of using TypeScript.

04:21:59.690 --> 04:22:03.560
So alternative here is that
we just change the type

04:22:03.560 --> 04:22:04.800
in our API file.

04:22:05.840 --> 04:22:09.570
And instead of a
todo-item being passed in,

04:22:09.570 --> 04:22:13.870
we can say that you can
send as an argument,

04:22:13.870 --> 04:22:18.260
you can pass any record or any object

04:22:18.260 --> 04:22:21.360
that contains a key value pair.

04:22:21.360 --> 04:22:23.030
And the way to do that

04:22:23.030 --> 04:22:27.670
with TypeScript is that we
replace that todo with a record

04:22:29.671 --> 04:22:34.550
of string and string for the time being.

04:22:34.550 --> 04:22:39.420
And what that does for us is,

04:22:39.420 --> 04:22:41.480
so we've got to close this.

04:22:41.480 --> 04:22:46.480
So we can now pass a
object that contains text,

04:22:47.150 --> 04:22:50.300
which you say a property and
the string has the value.

04:22:51.340 --> 04:22:52.310
And with that,

04:22:53.240 --> 04:22:56.680
this allows us to pass
