todo-items and you're trying

04:23:21.790 --> 04:23:26.790
to pass in something
that is not a todo-item.

04:23:27.410 --> 04:23:31.590
So even if you changed this to
data, which is our new name,

04:23:31.590 --> 04:23:32.740
it will still complain.

04:23:33.990 --> 04:23:38.760
Now we know as a fact
that the data we pass

04:23:39.990 --> 04:23:44.700
