04:23:58.060 --> 04:24:01.060
We'll look at that in a second,
but for now what we can do,

04:24:01.060 --> 04:24:04.920
we can tell TypeScript that, Hey, we are,

04:24:04.920 --> 04:24:06.850
we are sure, we know what we're doing.

04:24:06.850 --> 04:24:09.150
So we can say that this is a todo-item

