05:44:34.230 --> 05:44:37.510
and then tell Gitpod to
use that Docker container.

05:44:37.510 --> 05:44:39.700
So if we have special libraries

05:44:39.700 --> 05:44:42.320
or operating system dependencies,

05:44:42.320 --> 05:44:47.180
