installed and started.

05:44:56.570 --> 05:45:01.570
So the way we can do it is
we can use the image property

05:45:02.110 --> 05:45:06.550
and we specify Gitpod/workspace-Postgres.

05:45:11.380 --> 05:45:15.200
So this is an image that Gitpod maintains

05:45:15.200 --> 05:45:18.840
and provides to people who
use the environment here.

05:45:18.840 --> 05:45:22.750
