05:45:53.490 --> 05:45:54.410
that's an option too.

05:45:54.410 --> 05:45:56.570
And the Gitpod documentation

05:45:56.570 --> 05:45:59.146
explains how you can configure that.

05:45:59.146 --> 05:46:04.146
In our case, all we need
is the workspace-Postgres.

05:46:05.080 --> 05:46:08.980
And because we are now
