05:46:18.640 --> 05:46:21.260
which is the default port for Postgres.

05:46:21.260 --> 05:46:23.600
So if we do nothing else,

05:46:23.600 --> 05:46:26.100
other than adding this line for the image,

05:46:26.100 --> 05:46:29.740
every time we start a new
