05:46:40.830 --> 05:46:43.300
We know what the database
is installed and running,

05:46:43.300 --> 05:46:48.160
so we can add another port
definition to our ports array,

05:46:48.160 --> 05:46:50.610
where we just say port 5432.

05:46:52.140 --> 05:46:56.330
And when we open the workspace,

05:46:56.330 --> 05:47:00.100
we want to ignore that port,

05:47:01.150 --> 05:47:05.300
that just makes sure that nothing gets

05:47:05.300 --> 05:47:08.270
displayed at the bottom yet,
the port will be available

05:47:08.270 --> 05:47:12.340
so we can connect with a database client.

05:47:14.370 --> 05:47:19.080
