06:44:13.800 --> 06:44:14.633
Let's do that.

06:44:15.810 --> 06:44:19.620
Stop our frontend server
and start it back up,

06:44:21.950 --> 06:44:26.950
let all these scripts run
and do what they need to do.

06:44:29.910 --> 06:44:30.743
All right.

06:44:31.950 --> 06:44:35.200
There's a new preview, and guess what,

06:44:35.200 --> 06:44:39.470
it shows our item still
here because we fetched it

06:44:39.470 --> 06:44:41.120
from the database.

06:44:42.400 --> 06:44:45.480
Let's have a look at the done
column, it's currently false

06:44:47.045 --> 06:44:50.200
just to make sure updating
works as well, we check it.

06:44:50.200 --> 06:44:54.040
We come back and refresh,
and this now says true.

06:44:54.040 --> 06:44:55.970
And lastly, for good measure,

06:44:56.830 --> 06:45:01.830
first item persist in the Prisma Studio.

06:45:01.930 --> 06:45:03.550
First item is now persisted.

06:45:05.450 --> 06:45:10.450
What a wonderful time to be
a full stack web developer.

06:45:11.240 --> 06:45:14.060
So many tools that make life so easy.

