06:46:04.310 --> 06:46:07.950
With that, let's go ahead and commit that.

06:46:11.230 --> 06:46:13.110
We're now using the Prisma client.

06:46:14.310 --> 06:46:16.770
All right, let's commit.

06:46:17.610 --> 06:46:19.110
Yes.

06:46:19.110 --> 06:46:23.510
And then since we already
