06:56:14.550 --> 06:56:19.550
So because of that, we want
to run a script after we build

06:56:22.170 --> 06:56:26.650
that directory, so we can say
here in the package.json file,

06:56:29.150 --> 06:56:33.740
postbuild, so it just like we had a predev

06:56:34.890 --> 06:56:37.860
that runs before the dev
script, we have a build script

06:56:37.860 --> 06:56:39.260
and if we say post build,

06:56:40.785 --> 06:56:43.950
that script runs after
the build completes.

06:56:43.950 --> 06:56:45.250
So what we want to do here

06:56:46.240 --> 06:56:50.807
is copy our prisma/schema.prisma file.

06:56:52.700 --> 06:56:57.550
And we want to copy it
into that render directory

06:56:57.550 --> 06:57:00.930
that we have here, so let's right click

06:57:00.930 --> 06:57:04.450
