06:57:05.550 --> 06:57:10.260
And then in our copy
command, we'll paste that

06:57:10.260 --> 06:57:15.250
so that we go from
.vercel_build_output into here,

06:57:15.250 --> 06:57:18.590
functions, node, render,
add a slash at the end.

06:57:19.620 --> 06:57:21.380
So that copies the Prisma file.

06:57:21.380 --> 06:57:24.880
And there's one more thing we need to copy

06:57:25.850 --> 06:57:28.430
that are these binaryTargets.

06:57:28.430 --> 06:57:30.970
So they get generated

06:57:31.840 --> 06:57:36.270
by default into the node modules directory

06:57:36.270 --> 06:57:41.270
and within the node
modules, under the, @prisma,

06:57:43.270 --> 06:57:45.750
we have a directory here called engines

06:57:47.110 --> 06:57:48.966
and within the engines,

06:57:48.966 --> 06:57:53.966
you can see the lib query
engine debian open SSL

06:57:54.010 --> 06:57:59.010
something something, that
file or a similar name,

06:58:00.590 --> 06:58:03.900
depending on what environment Vercel runs

06:58:03.900 --> 06:58:08.410
needs to be copied into that
same functions directory.

06:58:08.410 --> 06:58:10.660
So that way we can do that is

06:58:11.570 --> 06:58:13.750
just like we copied that Prisma file.

06:58:14.670 --> 06:58:18.850
We can add another copy command,

06:58:18.850 --> 06:58:23.850
and this time let's go back
node modules, Prisma engines.

06:58:24.970 --> 06:58:26.790
We want to copy that relative path.

06:58:28.370 --> 06:58:32.125
So from that directory
under @prisma engines,

06:58:32.125 --> 06:58:34.980
we want to copy everything
that contains query

06:58:36.670 --> 06:58:39.630
and the place we want to copy it to

06:58:39.630 --> 06:58:43.770
is the same one here under
the Vercel build output

06:58:43.770 --> 06:58:47.820
functions, node, render, we'll
drop that at the end here.

06:58:49.670 --> 06:58:54.670
So that makes sure it
copies these query files,

06:58:55.230 --> 06:58:57.910
if there's more than one,
it would take all of them,

06:58:58.780 --> 06:59:00.180
put them in the right place.

06:59:01.320 --> 06:59:06.270
And the other thing we can do just in case

06:59:06.270 --> 06:59:09.510
