07:04:13.860 --> 07:04:18.860
When it comes to deploying
a SvelteKit application

07:04:19.590 --> 07:04:22.220
to, at the time of this recording,

07:04:23.435 --> 07:04:25.840
Vercel, Netlify, or CloudFlare,

07:04:25.840 --> 07:04:28.300
