07:05:58.220 --> 07:06:00.720
and then the project you want to deploy,

07:06:00.720 --> 07:06:03.760
in my case, that's the full
stack web development project.

07:06:04.660 --> 07:06:05.720
So I can import it.

07:06:06.690 --> 07:06:09.250
You can see that it
automatically recognizes this

07:06:09.250 --> 07:06:11.040
as a SvelteKit project.

07:06:11.040 --> 07:06:15.790
So it analyzed my code in
Github and it saw that this

07:06:15.790 --> 07:06:19.380
is a SvelteKit app, no need
for me to make any changes.

