07:09:00.130 --> 07:09:01.790
we can just go back to the top

07:09:01.790 --> 07:09:04.020
and click the back button here.

07:09:05.640 --> 07:09:10.140
That brings us to that page
where we can input a project.

07:09:10.140 --> 07:09:14.900
So if we just click at
the top on our team,

07:09:14.900 --> 07:09:19.560
we can now see that we have
that project configured here.

07:09:19.560 --> 07:09:21.140
And if we open it up,

07:09:21.140 --> 07:09:25.650
